	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Heri, venerandissime d. pater, cuidam puero commisi literas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderici a Salicibus</persName> ad te perferendas; nunc autem, cum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>iuratum tabellionem ex urbe vestra acceperimus, non <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>committam, quin literis etiam meis oneratus discedat, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quibus et reditum nostrum, et quid in eo evenerit, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>brevibus depingam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dextre ad penates nostros perve<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nimus omniaque salva invenimus dei gratia.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ammanus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>autem <placeName ref="l108">Davosius</placeName>, antequam lacum <placeName>Rivanum</placeName> attingeremus, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>recta quorundam negociorum suorum causa ad <placeName ref="l646">Gla<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ronenses</placeName> se contulit; nos soli lacum traiecimus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Subsecutus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>postero die <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName> pervenit mirifica narrans scommata, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quibus <placeName ref="l646">Glaronae</placeName> a malevolis fuit ictus et exceptus: '<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Quid nostra refert, quid <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName> reliqui constituerint?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ha<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>bemus in nostris manibus transitum peculiarem, cuius <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>iure utemur porro, sicuti incępimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ubi dominus <persName>Rhetiensis</persName>?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Si huc tecum venisset, vino nimirum honorario illum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>exciperemus scilicet etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec et alia eblaterarunt <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>temere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed haec omnia ammanus <persName>Fridolini</persName> sacris <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ascribit, quae tunc temporis celebrarunt temulenti; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nam postero die rogatus fuit, ne quid aegre ferret; plus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>satis enim in festo potatum fuisse.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Haec d. consul secreto <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mecum communicavit exspectans accessionem aliquam, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quam deinceps in socios querebundi exonerent.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Prae caeteris autem <persName>Ludo[v]icus Tschudius</persName> acrem se praebuit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quid fiat in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> inter proceres et quomodo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><placeName ref="l2652">Cyprum</placeName> <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicus</placeName> furor bello lacescere praesumpserit, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>procul dubio d. <persName ref="p8432">Fridericus</persName> ad te perscripsit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>expeditione autem Rhetica nihildum audio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Aber <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>zuͦ <placeName>Wesen</placeName> lag es als voll junger schnüderliggen; da was <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ouch das fendle und ein toubs geschrey.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Gott <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>erbarms!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Haec ad te ocyus, colendissime d. <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>pater, quibus subnectens vehementer oro <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>rogoque, ut nos tuae fidei et humanitati <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nu<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>nquam non habeas commendatos.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Literas etiam <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>puero dedi praedicto ad d. <persName ref="p1012">Ernium</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p1012">Leonhard Erni</persName>.</note>, amicorum optimo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>quas certe curatas cupidissime velim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te d. <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>consules, d. <persName ref="p1770">Carolus</persName>, qui ex te scire cupit, <foreign xml:lang="de">ob man ouch zuͦ <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> doctores mache der beider rechten, geistlich und w[eltl<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ich],</foreign> d. <persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName>, d. <persName ref="p20473">Gant<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>nerus</persName> et nemo non bonus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 14. martii 1570.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Tuae dominationi subiectissimus <persName ref="p8016">Th[obias] Eg[lius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Hennrico Bullinge<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ro</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae antistiti primario, domino patri suo s<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ingulari observantia <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Ann m. <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zür<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
